// plus signing formats of common webhook and API platforms and a signature checker.
// SHA-1/256/384/512 run on Web Crypto; MD5 and SHA-224 (not in Web Crypto) run on the
// implementations in the engine block. The key and message stay in this tab: the component
// never writes them to storage or the URL (persistence policy `disabled` in
// src/data/persistence.ts) and makes no network requests.
